 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "hierarchy is a list of rows [name, directReports]: one row per employee, names unique, the first row is the top-level executive (the root), every other employee appears in exactly one directReports list and the rows form one tree. employee1 and employee2 are names of employees in the tree (possibly equal). Return the name of their lowest common manager: the deepest employee that has both of them in its subtree, where an employee is in its own subtree.",
